{"check":"probe_openai_auth","fails_when":"the `--probe` credential check failed — the key resolved for that provider was rejected by a one-token authenticated completion","remediation":"re-issue or rotate the key — it resolves from the provider's env var, keys.openai in config.json, TAU_API_KEY, or --api-key","docs":"https://github.com/javimosch/tau/blob/master/docs/troubleshooting.md#setup--config-problems--tau-doctor"}
